    to activate, then place that monster on the top or bottom of your Deck. You can
    only use this effect of "Thunder Dragon Thunderstormech" once per turn. If a
    Thunder monster(s) you control would be destroyed by battle or card effect, you
    can banish 3 cards from your GY instead.'
